{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelAll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you add a task to a group after canceling the group,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that task is canceled immediately after being added to the group.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Immediately canceled child tasks should therefore cooperatively check for and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"react  to cancellation, e.g. by throwing an ","type":"text"},{"code":"CancellationError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"earliest convenience, or otherwise handling the cancellation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There are no restrictions on where you can call this method.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Code inside a child task or even another task can cancel a group,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"however one should be very careful to not keep a reference to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group longer than the ","type":"text"},{"code":"with...TaskGroup(...) { ... }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method body is executing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task.isCancelled"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"type":"aside","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DiscardingTaskGroup.isCancelled"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata"